// 6 B_Boss :
"P4112483679" "<em=curseyou>I know! I'll use the Temporal Disrupter! Even if it doesn't stop them, it'll show them what happens to people who mess with Malta!"
// 6 B_Boss :
"P2478268744" "Take that, ya varmints!"
