// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2947456142" "Now that you have recovered from the temporal disruption, it is time now to obtain the bait for the Freedom Phalanx! You have the Orestes Rifle and the security codes to the Vindicator's base. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go now and kidnap Ms. Liberty!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2736192346" "Assault Vindicators base"
// SendOffString :
"P705467546" "Ms. Liberty is the leader of the Vindicators and will not be taken down easily, especially in the defense of her base. Proper use of the Orestes Rifle should suppress the more powerful of the enchantments granted by the Well of Furies!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P417438129" "It is only a matter of time before the Vindicators discover their base is vulnerable. Assault the base at once!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P740143288" "The security codes you stole from the Longbow island fortress work perfectly, allowing you get past the worst of the Vindicators base defenses. Now to take down Ms. Liberty!"
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P937113693" "Arachnos operatives arrive to take away Ms. Liberty!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2558421407" "Keep a lookout. There's been a lot of trouble brewing lately."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2068913524" "Roger that!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P4249170158" "<shout>We got trouble!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 8 B_Boss_1 :
"P478396817" "<em=lecture>We all know what's going down. One of our Longbow island bases was attacked by a gang of viscious criminals from the Rogue Isles, and they got ahold of our security codes!"
// 8 B_Boss_1 :
"P1530683179" "By the look of it, they've already breached the base. What's more, one of our Warburg warzone operatives reported they might be after Ms. Liberty with some sort of special weapon!"
// 6 B_Boss_3 :
"P44696741" "Do not worry, Swan. The Vindicators will not let these villains get to Ms. Liberty!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P368479866" "Swan"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1027416640" "Mynx"
// Script Variable BOSS_3_DISPLAYNAME :
"P605437514" "Valkyrie"
// Script Variable BOSS_4_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1759429092" "Luminary"

