// IntroString :
"P2587160426" "The final confrontation with the Freedom Phalanx is at hand! I have sent word to the group in Paragon City, setting the terms for the conflict. They are to clear Atlas Park so only true heroes and villains may clash! He will show up with some Longbow agents to cordon off the area so citizens would not get hurt. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go now and defeat the greatest of heroes, the Freedom Phalanx!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3589629657" "Defeat the Freedom Phalanx"
// SendOffString :
"P3394114310" "This will be a great triumph! To have the Phalanx publically defeated will be a glorious victory!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P652550661" "Why do you delay? The defeat of the Phalanx is so close I can taste it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P693282739" "It is time for the final confrontation with the Freedom Phalanx!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 2 B_Boss_1 :
"P1820645336" "<f=M_Object>No... Ms. Liberty!"
// 6 B_Boss_1 :
"P2093894444" "She believed in Recluse... and he had you all do THIS!"
// 3 B_Boss_1 :
"P1773126282" "<f=Camera em=curseyou>How could you do this?!"
// 3 B_Boss_1 :
"P1038854763" "The Phalanx won't let you get away with this!"
